# sequin's sweep: the pitch falls from the note's start and, out of hearing (20 Hz), the chip falls silent till the
# next note (dsp/chip.h CH_SWEEP_HZ). Before, a held note's fall stopped at LOFI's 8 Hz floor and stayed there: a
# full-scale 8 Hz click train (a pulse; the noise a held DC) for as long as the note was held. And the knob is even in
# ratio (CH_SWEEP_OCT): 1 already sweeps (8 semitones a second), 127 is LOFI's fastest; before, 1..7 did nothing and 8 up
# all zapped alike. The rate shows here as how long a C4 takes to fall out of hearing (44.5 semitones): knob 1 ~5.6 s,
# 32 ~1.6 s, 64 ~0.44 s, 96 ~0.12 s, 127 ~35 ms (tests/host/chip_test.c measures the pitch itself). Picked from SEL's
# list by name (ENGINE, ten steps on from knit), the sweep on knob 4, its sends off (no echo in the tail)
wait 300
spin ALGO 1
expect trk 2
tap EDIT
expect page Engine
tap SEL
row ENGINE
turn ALGO 10 30
tap SEL
wait 40
expect par2.engine 11
param 2 send1 0
param 2 send2 0
# knob 1: the slowest, a glide still sounding a second on (it was no sweep at all: that held too, see 0 below)
spin K4 1
expect par2.e4 1
play 2 60 on 100
wait 1000
peakreset
wait 300
expect peak_db_min -45
play 2 60 off
wait 400
# 32: still sounding at 1 s, silent by 1.9 s (before: silent at 0.1 s, the click train after)
spin K4 31
expect par2.e4 32
play 2 60 on 100
wait 1000
peakreset
wait 300
expect peak_db_min -45
wait 600
peakreset
wait 300
expect peak_db_max -70
play 2 60 off
wait 400
# 64: sounding at 0.25 s, silent from 0.6 s, held or not
spin K4 32
expect par2.e4 64
play 2 60 on 100
wait 250
peakreset
wait 100
expect peak_db_min -45
wait 250
peakreset
wait 500
expect peak_db_max -70
play 2 60 off
wait 400
shot sequin_sweep64.png
# 96: sounding at 40 ms, silent from 0.2 s
spin K4 32
expect par2.e4 96
play 2 60 on 100
wait 40
peakreset
wait 40
expect peak_db_min -45
wait 120
peakreset
wait 300
expect peak_db_max -70
play 2 60 off
wait 400
# 127: the zap, silent from 80 ms; the next note zaps again (the sweep from the start)
spin K4 31
expect par2.e4 127
shot sequin_sweep127.png
play 2 60 on 100
peakreset
wait 20
expect peak_db_min -45
wait 60
peakreset
wait 400
expect peak_db_max -70
play 2 60 off
wait 300
peakreset
play 2 72 on 100
wait 20
expect peak_db_min -45
wait 60
peakreset
wait 300
expect peak_db_max -70
play 2 72 off
# the noise: its held DC gone too
spin K1 3
expect par2.e1 3
wait 300
play 2 60 on 100
wait 100
peakreset
wait 300
expect peak_db_max -70
play 2 60 off
wait 200
# no sweep: the note holds (the end is the sweep's only)
spin K4 -127
expect par2.e4 0
spin K1 -3
play 2 60 on 100
wait 1000
peakreset
wait 300
expect peak_db_min -45
play 2 60 off
wait 300
